flowchart TD
  A([Processing step]) --> B{Failure?}
  B -->|No| C[Continue request]
  B -->|Yes| D[Classify failure]
  D --> E{Client input or policy?}
  E -->|Malformed input| E400[400 / 413]
  E -->|Identity invalid| E401[401]
  E -->|Permission denied| E403[403]
  E -->|Quota exceeded| E429[429]
  E -->|Unknown route| E404[404]
  E -->|Upstream failure| F{Timeout?}
  F -->|Yes| E504[504]
  F -->|No| E502[502 / 503]
  E400 --> G[Build stable public error envelope]
  E401 --> G
  E403 --> G
  E429 --> G
  E404 --> G
  E504 --> G
  E502 --> G
  G --> H[Record sanitized diagnostic event]
  H --> I([Respond with correlation ID])
